'''Pinky Bear''' (ピンキークマ先生, ''Pinkī Kuma-sensei'', '''Pinky Teacher Bear''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Pinky Bear
|image = E 781.png
|first appearance = [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
Essentially a stronger version of [[Teacher Bear]], the only visual difference being a Pinky mask on his head. He boasts [[Knockback]] and [[Slow]] on top of a faster attack rate, which can prove to be annoying for many early game players, especially when buffed, though just like Teacher Bear, doesn't hold much dps on his own and doesn't have enough bulk to live long normally.

==Strategy==
Fight him like you would in [[Empire of Cats]], i.e., by spamming meatshields like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] and stacking [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]], the only difference being that he might push harder. Other than that his appearances usually buffing him up to a high level makes it so that you might need an extra meatshield to cover the gaps if his abilities proc too much.

